when I was there and then later I figured I can't&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:46.560 --> 00:00:54.240
really retire at that age, so I got closer to the&nbsp;
US and moved over to Tijuana/Rosarito Beach area.&nbsp;&nbsp;

