At the end of the day Mexico now it's my&nbsp;
home. I've been there over 20 years and so&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:03.920 --> 00:01:09.040
it's just more comfortable for me. It's easier&nbsp;
to live there, less stress, things of that sort.&nbsp;&nbsp;

