00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:23.680
got all kind of different looks, the mountains,&nbsp;
the hills, the trees. I mean the oceans, the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:24.800 --> 00:01:29.520
deserts, anything you want to shoot there and&nbsp;
I think it's one of the only places that can&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:30.240 --> 00:01:36.080
(at least on the western hemisphere) that can&nbsp;
be truly cost effective without the rebates.

